    "title": "Rock-Crushing Permit Still Approved In Ansonia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Jasmine Wright ,\n19 hours ago ANSONIA – Members of the planning and zoning commission voted 4 – 1 July 27 to allow rock-crushing at the Burns Construction facility on Riverside Drive, after a legal battle resurfaced before the commission earlier this year. Commissioners Jared Heon, William Phipps, Maureen McCormack and Dana Haigh voted... Read full article",
